        "created_at": "2021-12-02T15:58:36.428Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ultimate Voss has decided to invade Earth through the Ruins of Atlantis. Tempest has infiltrated the operation by being captured, but can his allies Termi-Nation Bunker, X-Treme Fanatic. and Grandpa Legacy save him before he gets Gene-Bound?</p>\n<p>Ultimate Reminders:<br>\nFront Side: Reduce damage dealt by heroes by 1, when Voss flips play a card<br>\nBack Side: At the end of the turn play a card, when Voss flips play a card</p>\n<p>Good Luck Heroes!</p>",
